  "overview": {
    "en": "Farmer Jabez Stone, about to lose his land, agrees to sell his soul to the devil, known as Mr. Scratch, who gives Jabez seven years to enjoy the fruits of his sale before he collects. Over that time, Jabez pays off his debts and helps many neighboring farmers, then becomes an advocate for the upstanding Sen. Daniel Webster. When Jabez's contract with Mr. Scratch concludes, he desperately turns to Webster to represent him in a trial for his soul.",
    "tr": "On dokuzuncu yüzyılda ekonomik açıdan başarılı olmak için şeytanla anlaşan New Hampshire'lı bir çiftçi, anlaşmayı bozmak için Daniel Webster'ın desteğini alma hikayesi...Fantastik ögeler barındıran ,yapıldığı yıla göre ortalamanın üzerinde bir film."
